    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74273" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυ-ήκοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quick of hearing : of quick
				perception, keen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴσθησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					75b
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					534a6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				295.23
			</span></i>.—In codd. sts. wrongly <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύκοος, ὀξυκοΐα</span> : 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυηκοώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pr.Im.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.8
			</span></i> : 
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυηκοώτατος</span> prob. l. in <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.65
			</span></i>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυηκούστατος.</span></div>
